'''Pan-Andalusianism''' ({{langx|al|Panandalusi-môh|lit=Andaluicity}}; {{Langx|bl|Panandalucismo}}) is an [[Andalusian language|Andalusian]] term alluding to the group of people, countries, and communities that share the [[Andalusian languages]] and Andalusian culture. The term can have various, different implications and meanings depending on country of origin, socio-political views, and cultural background.

